control_cli_events {"model": "gpt-6-luna", "events": "{\"type\":\"thread.started\",\"thread_id\":\"01a167e0-e54b-7383-8b63-0b88ba065b60\"}\n{\"type\":\"turn.started\"}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"task_summary\\\":\\\"Implement run-length encoding in solution.py, add public unittest regression coverage, and document design decisions and the verification command in HANDOFF.md.\\\",\\\"constraints\\\":[\\\"Work only in the supplied task workspace.\\\",\\\"Edit solution.py and public tests; HANDOFF.md is an allowed output.\\\",\\\"Use Python 3.11+ and the standard library.\\\",\\\"Do not access parent repositories or external services.\\\",\\\"Encode adjacent equal strings as (value, count) pairs; nonadjacent equal values form separate runs; empty input returns [].\\\",\\\"Maintain type hints and do not mutate input collections.\\\",\\\"No algorithmic complexity constraint is imposed.\\\",\\\"Verify with python -m unittest discover -v.\\\",\\\"test_solution.py must contain at least 3 passing unittest test methods exercising the public API.\\\",\\\"HANDOFF.md must include design decisions and the verification command.\\\"],\\\"success_criteria\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-1\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"solution.py defines the public run-length encoding API with type hints.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"regex\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"solution.py\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"def\\\\\\\\s+\\\\\\\\w+\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\([^)]*\\\\\\\\)\\\\\\\\s*->\\\\\\\\s*[^:]+:\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-2\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The implementation handles adjacent runs, separates nonadjacent equal strings, returns an empty list for empty input, and does not mutate the input collection.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"llm_judge\\\",\\\"rubric\\\":\\\"Read solution.py and assess whether its public implementation run-length encodes adjacent equal strings into (value, count) pairs, separates nonadjacent equal values into distinct runs, returns [] for empty input, maintains type hints, and avoids mutating input collections. Judge only behavior and content visible in the file; do not rely on execution logs.\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-3\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"solution.py compiles under Python.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-4\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"test_solution.py contains at least three unittest test methods.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"regex\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"test_solution.py\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"(?s)(?=.*class\\\\\\\\s+\\\\\\\\w+\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\([^)]*unittest\\\\\\\\.TestCase[^)]*\\\\\\\\))(?:(?!\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\s*class\\\\\\\\s+).)*\\\"}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-5\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"The public unittest suite passes using the requested discovery command.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"command\\\",\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"SC-6\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"HANDOFF.md records design decisions and the verification command.\\\",\\\"check\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"regex\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"HANDOFF.md\\\",\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"(?is)(?=.*design decision)(?=.*python -m unittest discover -v)\\\"}}],\\\"verification\\\":[{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m py_compile solution.py\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}},{\\\"command\\\":\\\"python -m unittest discover -v\\\",\\\"expected\\\":{\\\"exit_code\\\":0}}],\\\"stop_conditions\\\":[],\\\"assumptions\\\":[\\\"The named files are relative to the supplied task workspace; solution.py, test_solution.py, and HANDOFF.md may not exist yet and may be created.\\\",\\\"The request does not specify the public function name or signature; the implementation and tests must choose a coherent public API, and the contract's type-hint check only requires a typed function definition.\\\",\\\"The test discovery command is expected to discover test_solution.py from the workspace root and the suite is expected to be discoverable by unittest.\\\",\\\"The test method count is a content requirement; passing the requested unittest command is the proposed check for passing coverage.\\\"]}\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":17401,\"cached_input_tokens\":14976,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":739,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":0}}\n"}
